    narr:narration """The decision to adopt Zypherion as the core engine for the analytics pipeline was formalized on August 28, 2026, driven by a [clear performance mandate](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) to resolve existing columnar query bottlenecks. Quinton Fairweather initiated the [adoption commitment](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1), framing the transition as a [concrete future migration](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) scheduled for the upcoming quarter. This trajectory is reinforced by XenaExpertgh, who synthesized the [strategic shift](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4), [performance expectations](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5), and [execution timeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6) into a structured summary. The discourse remains unified around the technical necessity of the upgrade, with both actors aligning on the projected 15x efficiency gain as the primary justification for the architectural pivot.""" ;
